		dataType="Comment";
		class PositionInfo {position[]={0,0,-8};};
		title="Airborne Gunship Support (Minimal): the smallest working existing-aircraft call. The armed Blackfish includes its complete four-person BLUFOR editor crew: pilot, copilot and both weapon operators. Registration uses that crew and does not create replacements. The aircraft orbits its spawn position with default radius/altitude because no orbit was supplied. Use the Full example to edit every option. Wiki: https://github.com/AdamWaldie/WaldosMissionPack/wiki/Airborne-Gunship-Support";
